This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is I39 in scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh, which install.sh does not ship.
ledger-reverify.sh and SKILL.md step 3f ship; the invariant that joins their status sets does
not. On a consumer the fixture resolves no validator, prints a SKIP and exits 0, so the
consumer's pool recorded it `ok` on every push while it tested nothing.

The consumer's ledger engine is covered there by ledger-reverify, ledger-rotate and
ledger-reverify-unfalsifiable, which ship. This one must not be confused for those.
